{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-09-27 16:05:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL BOLSTERS DIGITAL AUTOMATION CAPABILITIES IN LIFE SCIENCES THROUGH ACQUISITION OF PERFORMIX INC.', 'text': 'HOUSTON, SEPT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ACQUIRED PRIVATELY HELD PERFORMIX INC., A PROVIDER OF MANUFACTURING EXECUTION SYSTEM (MES) SOFTWARE FOR THE PHARMACEUTICAL MANUFACTURING AND BIOTECH INDUSTRIES.'}{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-09-27 09:17:00', 'title': 'LARGE MIDWEST FOOD SUPPLIER MODERNIZES DISTRIBUTION CENTER OPERATIONS WITH HONEYWELL TECHNOLOGIES', 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C., SEPT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ONE OF THE LARGEST SUPPLIERS OF FRESH AND FROZEN PRODUCE AND FRUIT IN THE MIDWEST HAS DEPLOYED THE COMPANY'S MOBILE COMPUTERS, TABLETS AND SOFTWARE TO HELP ITS MOBILE WORKERS PICK, PACK AND SHIP PERISHABLES."}